<title>CHINA: GOLDEN RES YEAR NET DOWN 4.32 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>GOLDEN RES YEAR NET DOWN 4.32 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.0	vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  6.23 loss vs 13.43 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    47.35     vs 49.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,087.84  vs 873.65</p>
<p>    Company name		 Golden Resources Development</p>
<p>				     International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Golden Resources distributes rice.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for diminution in value of other investment.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is two H.K. cents (including interim dividend of one cent) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
